        "excerpt": "[ANNOUNCEMENT posted 2026-10-02T10:49:07.000085+00:00 by TEAM_LEAD (safety_batch_08): not established as handling for this topic until you show it is relevant and gives a directive.]\nQA tracking (SAFETY-8147): Submit control cannot complete labeled tasks; seen across projects. Add affected task references here; no policy change has been announced.\n\nContext reply [1790938198.000113] by U014 (QA_TUTOR):\nDoes the interface show a saved/submitted receipt or just the same task again? A selected label is not a completed submission until LT confirms it."
